	(text "NRST — Negative Reset (reset pin for the MCU)\n\nPulling NRST low = resetting entire MCU, halting \nevery code/program execution, and reinitializing \nregisters. Acts as a debugger to reset/hold chip while \nflashing firmware"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 136.652 56.134 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "11410c94-bb2c-4e5b-b62e-b6cea15c4332")
	)
	(text "3V 128M-BIT\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 302.514 120.396 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "116e9592-8bba-43f7-a666-8ba5ae49e015")
	)
	(text "The Flash is not volatile to mechanical \nvibrations as opposed to a standard SD card, \nand it's extremely fast and compact. The Flash\nchip will store all the flight data until the \nrocket has landed/stopped and then transfer it \nover to the micro-SD card."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 368.554 145.542 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "272ebaa3-c0fd-4a1b-bf4c-74a34e71cb69")
	)
